<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts two aluminum cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts two aluminum cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs said it downgraded Aluminum Co of America to market perform from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Also downgraded Alumax Inc to market perform from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares in Alumax fell 3/4 to 32-3/8 and Alcoa fell two points to 58-1/2.</p>
</text>
